# Claude Code -- per-developer local overrides only.
# CLAUDE.md at the project root is deliberately NOT ignored: it is shared context, and a
# newcomer cloning main should get it. Neither are .claude/settings.json, the hooks or the
# status line -- those are shared too.
#
# This line used to read `.github`, which was a typo for `.claude` and had teeth: an ignored
# DIRECTORY is pruned during pathspec expansion, so `git add .github/workflows/ci.yml` was
# refused even though ci.yml is tracked and in HEAD. CI could not be edited without -f, and the
# refusal names .github rather than the typo. Found while adding a phase 3 step to the workflow.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Subagent-driven development scratch: ledgers, briefs, review packages.
# Git history is the record; this is working state for an in-flight plan.
.superpowers/

# Editor config. .vscode/settings.json pins dbt.dbtPath to an absolute path that is
# machine-specific, so it stays local rather than being shared (see CLAUDE.md, dbt section).
.vscode/
